SUMMARY:Silent Book Club at Great Bear Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Silent Book Club at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis Thursday\, August 20 | 6–8 PM\nTicket Includes: A Glass of Wine\nLooking for the perfect excuse to slow down and unplug? Join us for Silent Book Club at Great Bear Vineyards—an evening dedicated to good books\, great wine\, and peaceful vineyard surroundings.\nBring the book you’ve been meaning to finish\, find a cozy spot in our beautiful gardens\, and settle in with a glass of estate-grown wine. Whether you come on your own or with friends\, there’s no assigned reading\, no pressure\, and no deadlines—just uninterrupted time to relax and enjoy a great story.\nYour ticket includes your first glass of wine\, with your choice of four delicious wines. After that\, you’re welcome to linger as long as you’d like\, enjoying another glass or a bottle while soaking in the tranquil vineyard atmosphere.\n Cheese\, charcuterie\, and light snacks will be available for purchase\, making it easy to pair your favorite chapter with the perfect bite.\nWhether you’re an avid reader or simply looking for a peaceful way to spend your evening\, Silent Book Club is the perfect blend of relaxation\, community\, and great wine.\nGrab your current read\, pour a glass\, and escape into a story with us. We can’t wait to see you at the vineyard!
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/silent-book-club-at-great-bear-vineyards/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards  24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
